F/A-18 Hornet  Armament: 1 M61 cannon with 540 rounds, max external ordnance 17,000 lb on 9 stations including wingtips for AIM-9s, centerline for bombs or tanks, two on fuselage for AAMRAAMs, tanks, etc, inboard wing for air-surface missiles (HARMS, Shrikes, Harpoons, Mavericks, LBUs) outboard wing for AAMRAMMs. 